msgstr "VPN je zastavená"

msgid "The VPN is restarting"
msgstr "VPN sa reštartuje"

msgid "With the kill switch on, nothing leaves the device or the LAN outside the tunnel: while the VPN is down, starting or broken, every connection fails instead of going out directly. It stays up until you stop the VPN here (Stop removes it)."
msgstr "So zapnutým kill switchom nič neopustí zariadenie ani LAN mimo tunela: keď je VPN vypnutá, spúšťa sa alebo je pokazená, každé spojenie zlyhá namiesto toho, aby išlo priamo. Zostáva aktívny, kým tu VPN nezastavíte (Zastaviť ho odstráni)."

msgid "Without the kill switch, traffic goes out directly, unprotected, whenever the tunnel is down (while it starts, after a crash, when the engine is missing)."
msgstr "Bez kill switchu ide prevádzka priamo a nechránene vždy, keď tunel nefunguje (pri spúšťaní, po páde, pri chýbajúcom engine)."

msgid "Turn the kill switch on?"
msgstr "Zapnúť kill switch?"

msgid "Turn the kill switch off?"
msgstr "Vypnúť kill switch?"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Zapnúť"

msgid "unknown"
msgstr "neznáme"

msgid "The exit address could not be found (is the tunnel up?)"
msgstr "Výstupnú adresu sa nepodarilo zistiť (je tunel pripojený?)"

msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "Pripája sa…"

msgid "On, but not running"
msgstr "Zapnuté, ale nebeží"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "Zastavené"

