msgstr "Zastaviť VPN?"

msgid "Traffic then goes out directly, without the tunnel; the kill switch is taken down with it."
msgstr "Prevádzka potom pôjde priamo, bez tunela; kill switch sa odstráni spolu s ním."

msgid "The VPN is on: it starts again by itself after a reboot."
msgstr "VPN je zapnutá: po reštarte sa spustí znova sama."

msgid "The VPN is off."
msgstr "VPN je vypnutá."

msgid "Kill switch"
msgstr "Kill switch"

msgid "Setting"
msgstr "Nastavenie"

msgid "Active: only the tunnel can reach the internet"
msgstr "Aktívny: na internet sa dostane len tunel"

msgid "Not active"
msgstr "Neaktívny"

msgid "The kill switch blocks all traffic of the device and of the LAN while the VPN is down, so nothing ever leaves without the tunnel. If the tunnel cannot come up (a dead server, an expired account), the device stays offline until you fix the profile or stop the VPN. The panel itself stays reachable from the LAN."
msgstr "Kill switch blokuje všetku prevádzku zariadenia aj LAN, kým je VPN vypnutá, takže nič nikdy neopustí zariadenie bez tunela. Ak sa tunel nepodarí vytvoriť (mŕtvy server, vypršaný účet), zariadenie zostane offline, kým neopravíte profil alebo nezastavíte VPN. Samotný panel zostáva dostupný z LAN."

msgid "Choose a profile"
msgstr "Vyberte profil"

msgid "No profiles yet"
msgstr "Zatiaľ žiadne profily"

msgid "engine not installed"
msgstr "engine nie je nainštalovaný"

msgid "Use"
msgstr "Použiť"

msgid "Switched: the VPN restarts on the new profile"
msgstr "Prepnuté: VPN sa reštartuje s novým profilom"

msgid "Active profile"
msgstr "Aktívny profil"

msgid "A running VPN restarts on the profile you choose; the kill switch stays up in between."
msgstr "Bežiaca VPN sa reštartuje s profilom, ktorý vyberiete; kill switch medzitým zostáva aktívny."

msgid "Manage the profiles"
msgstr "Spravovať profily"

msgid "Automatic: through the tunnel where the engine can carry it"
msgstr "Automaticky: cez tunel, ak ho engine zvládne"

msgid "Ask the engine for IPv6 in the tunnel"
msgstr "Vyžiadať od enginu IPv6 v tuneli"

msgid "Never through the tunnel (blocked while the VPN is up)"
msgstr "Nikdy cez tunel (blokované, kým VPN beží)"

msgid "Saved: it applies from the next start (Restart)"
msgstr "Uložené: použije sa od ďalšieho spustenia (Reštartovať)"

msgid "IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6"

msgid "The tunnel carries IPv6"
msgstr "Tunel prenáša IPv6"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Áno"

msgid "IPv6 guard"
msgstr "Ochrana IPv6"

msgid "Active: IPv6 outside the tunnel is refused"
msgstr "Aktívna: IPv6 mimo tunela sa odmieta"

msgid "While the VPN is up, IPv6 never leaves beside a tunnel that does not carry it: it is refused at once, so programs and LAN clients fall back to IPv4 instead of leaking or waiting. Automatic: WireGuard and OpenVPN use the IPv6 addresses of their config; Xray, sing-box and mihomo are asked at every start whether IPv6 works through the tunnel, and carry it only then; dae stays IPv4."
msgstr "Kým VPN beží, IPv6 nikdy neodíde popri tuneli, ktorý ho neprenáša: okamžite sa odmietne, takže programy a klienti LAN prejdú na IPv4 namiesto úniku alebo čakania. Automaticky: WireGuard a OpenVPN používajú adresy IPv6 zo svojej konfigurácie; pri Xray, sing-box a mihomo sa pri každom spustení overí, či IPv6 cez tunel funguje, a prenášajú ho len vtedy; dae zostáva na IPv4."

msgid "%d ms"
msgstr "%d ms"

msgid "UDP: not testable"
msgstr "UDP: nedá sa otestovať"

msgid "blocked by the kill switch"
msgstr "zablokované kill switchom"

msgid "A WireGuard or OpenVPN config, a Clash/mihomo YAML, an Xray or sing-box JSON, a dae config"
msgstr "Konfigurácia WireGuard alebo OpenVPN, YAML Clash/mihomo, JSON Xray alebo sing-box, konfigurácia dae"

msgid "After OK, choose the file: a WireGuard .conf, an OpenVPN .ovpn, a Clash/mihomo .yaml, an Xray or sing-box .json or a dae config (at most 1 MiB)."
msgstr "Po OK vyberte súbor: WireGuard .conf, OpenVPN .ovpn, Clash/mihomo .yaml, Xray alebo sing-box .json alebo konfiguráciu dae (najviac 1 MiB)."

msgid "From the source"
msgstr "Zo zdroja"

msgid "Detect"
msgstr "Rozpoznať"

msgid "The URL may hold a token: it goes to the device on its own, never into a command line or a log."
msgstr "URL môže obsahovať token: do zariadenia sa posiela samostatne, nikdy nie do príkazového riadka ani záznamu."

msgid "Share link"
msgstr "Zdieľaný odkaz"

msgid "Paste"
msgstr "Vložiť"

msgid "File"
msgstr "Súbor"

msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

