msgstr "Neplatný názov: 1-64 znakov, bez riadiacich znakov"

msgid "Add a profile"
msgstr "Pridať profil"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Názov"

msgid "Detect: the module tells the kind from the link or the file. Choose the type for a JSON that could be either Xray or sing-box, or for a link that should run on another engine."
msgstr "Rozpoznať: modul určí druh z odkazu alebo súboru. Typ vyberte pri JSON, ktorý môže byť Xray aj sing-box, alebo pri odkaze, ktorý má bežať na inom engine."

msgid "The profile is added"
msgstr "Profil bol pridaný"

msgid "Rename the profile"
msgstr "Premenovať profil"

msgid "Delete the profile %s?"
msgstr "Odstrániť profil %s?"

msgid "It is the active profile: with the VPN on, the module refuses; stop the VPN or choose another profile first."
msgstr "Je to aktívny profil: pri zapnutej VPN modul odmietne; najprv zastavte VPN alebo vyberte iný profil."

msgid "Its config and credentials are deleted from the device."
msgstr "Jeho konfigurácia a prihlasovacie údaje sa zo zariadenia odstránia."

msgid "Deleted"
msgstr "Odstránené"

msgid "The profile passes the check"
msgstr "Profil prešiel kontrolou"

msgid "Show the config?"
msgstr "Zobraziť konfiguráciu?"

msgid "The config holds the credentials of the profile (keys, passwords, UUIDs). It is shown on this screen only; anyone who can see the screen can read it."
msgstr "Konfigurácia obsahuje prihlasovacie údaje profilu (kľúče, heslá, UUID). Zobrazí sa len na tejto obrazovke; môže ju prečítať každý, kto obrazovku vidí."

msgid "Saving checks the config with the engine first (profile edit); a config that does not pass is not saved and the old one stays."
msgstr "Pri ukladaní sa konfigurácia najprv skontroluje enginom (profile edit); konfigurácia, ktorá neprejde, sa neuloží a zostane stará."

msgid "This profile comes from a subscription: its next refresh replaces your changes."
msgstr "Tento profil pochádza z odberu: jeho ďalšie obnovenie prepíše vaše zmeny."

msgid "Config of %s"
msgstr "Konfigurácia %s"

msgid "Rename"
msgstr "Premenovať"

msgid "Show / edit the config"
msgstr "Zobraziť / upraviť konfiguráciu"

msgid "Test the latency of all"
msgstr "Zmerať latenciu všetkých"

msgid "No profiles yet: add one from a share link, a config file or a subscription."
msgstr "Zatiaľ žiadne profily: pridajte jeden zo zdieľaného odkazu, konfiguračného súboru alebo odberu."

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktívny"

msgid "This profile is the active one now"
msgstr "Tento profil je teraz aktívny"

msgid "More"
msgstr "Viac"

msgid "active"
msgstr "aktívny"

msgid "subscription"
msgstr "odber"

msgid "migrated"
msgstr "migrovaný"

msgid "gone from its subscription"
msgstr "zmizol zo svojho odberu"

msgid "Server"
msgstr "Server"

msgid "Engine"
msgstr "Engine"

msgid "Latency"
msgstr "Latencia"

msgid "The latency is a TCP connection to the server, through the tunnel when the VPN is up. WireGuard and OpenVPN servers usually speak UDP and cannot be tested this way."
msgstr "Latencia je spojenie TCP so serverom, cez tunel, keď VPN beží. Servery WireGuard a OpenVPN zvyčajne používajú UDP a týmto spôsobom sa testovať nedajú."

msgid "Enter an IPv4 or IPv6 address"
msgstr "Zadajte adresu IPv4 alebo IPv6"

msgid "On: nothing leaves outside the tunnel"
msgstr "Zapnuté: nič neopustí zariadenie mimo tunela"

msgid "Off: traffic goes out directly while the tunnel is down"
msgstr "Vypnuté: prevádzka ide priamo, kým je tunel vypnutý"

msgid "Yes: Tailscale's own connections go through the tunnel"
msgstr "Áno: vlastné spojenia Tailscale idú cez tunel"

msgid "No: Tailscale connects directly"
msgstr "Nie: Tailscale sa pripája priamo"

msgid "Routing"
msgstr "Smerovanie"

msgid "The kill switch blocks all traffic of the device and of the LAN while the VPN is down."
msgstr "Kill switch blokuje všetku prevádzku zariadenia a LAN, kým je VPN vypnutá."

msgid "Bypass the tunnel"
msgstr "Obísť tunel"

msgid "Enter address ranges like 192.168.0.0/16, separated by commas"
msgstr "Zadajte rozsahy adries, napr. 192.168.0.0/16, oddelené čiarkami"

msgid "Address ranges that never go into the tunnel, besides the LAN itself (which never does). Empty: the LAN only."
msgstr "Rozsahy adries, ktoré nikdy nejdú do tunela, okrem samotnej LAN (tá nejde nikdy). Prázdne: len LAN."

msgid "Tailscale through the VPN"
msgstr "Tailscale cez VPN"

msgid "When Tailscale runs on the device, its WireGuard, DERP and control connections go through whichever tunnel runs (dae catches them like any other)."
msgstr "Keď na zariadení beží Tailscale, jeho spojenia WireGuard, DERP a riadiace idú cez ktorýkoľvek bežiaci tunel (dae ich zachytí ako všetko ostatné)."

msgid "DNS"
msgstr "DNS"

msgid "DNS through the tunnel"
msgstr "DNS cez tunel"

msgid "The resolver the device's and the LAN's lookups go to, through the tunnel. Nothing goes to the carrier's resolver."
msgstr "Resolver, na ktorý idú dotazy zariadenia a LAN cez tunel. Nič nejde na resolver operátora."

msgid "Bootstrap DNS"
msgstr "Úvodné DNS"

msgid "Finds the VPN server's own address before the tunnel is up (directly, on the engine's own connection)."
msgstr "Nájde adresu samotného servera VPN pred vytvorením tunela (priamo, cez vlastné spojenie enginu)."

msgid "Empty puts a setting back to its default."
msgstr "Prázdne hodnotu vráti na predvolenú."

msgid "TUN stack"
msgstr "Zásobník TUN"

msgid "Default (gvisor)"
msgstr "Predvolené (gvisor)"

msgid "system (not on the 5.4 kernel)"
msgstr "system (nie na jadre 5.4)"

msgid "set (unchanged unless you type a new one)"
msgstr "nastavené (nezmení sa, kým nezadáte novú)"

msgid "not set"
msgstr "nenastavené"

msgid "Upstream HTTP proxy"
msgstr "Nadradený proxy HTTP"

msgid "TLS certificate pin (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Pripnutie certifikátu TLS (SHA-256)"

msgid "Enter host:port"
msgstr "Zadajte host:port"

msgid "Enter the SHA-256 in hex"
msgstr "Zadajte SHA-256 v hex tvare"

msgid "Profile options"
msgstr "Možnosti profilu"

msgid "None of the profiles has options of its type."
msgstr "Žiadny z profilov nemá možnosti svojho typu."

msgid "mihomo's mode (rule, global, direct), the engines' log levels, dae's groups and routing are part of each profile's own config: VPN > Profiles, Show / edit the config."
msgstr "Režim mihomo (rule, global, direct), úrovne záznamu enginov, skupiny a smerovanie dae sú súčasťou vlastnej konfigurácie každého profilu: VPN > Profily, Zobraziť / upraviť konfiguráciu."

msgid "Delete the subscription %s?"
msgstr "Odstrániť odber %s?"

msgid "Its profiles can go with it or stay as profiles of their own. The active profile is never removed while the VPN is on."
msgstr "Jeho profily môžu odísť s ním alebo zostať ako samostatné profily. Aktívny profil sa nikdy neodstráni, kým VPN beží."

msgid "Keep the profiles"
msgstr "Ponechať profily"

msgid "Delete with its profiles"
msgstr "Odstrániť aj s profilmi"

msgid "Only by hand"
msgstr "Len ručne"

msgid "Every %d h"
msgstr "Každých %d h"

msgid "Share links: one profile per link"
msgstr "Zdieľané odkazy: jeden profil na odkaz"

msgid "Clash/mihomo YAML: one mihomo profile"
msgstr "YAML Clash/mihomo: jeden profil mihomo"

msgid "dae: one profile with every node in one group"
msgstr "dae: jeden profil so všetkými uzlami v jednej skupine"

msgid "Add a subscription"
msgstr "Pridať odber"

msgid "Format"
msgstr "Formát"

msgid "The URL usually holds your account token: it is stored on the device readable by root only, and never shown again. The subscription is fetched over the device's own connection: through the tunnel when the VPN is up; with the kill switch up and the tunnel down it cannot be fetched."
msgstr "URL zvyčajne obsahuje token vášho účtu: ukladá sa v zariadení čitateľný len pre root a už sa nezobrazí. Odber sa sťahuje vlastným spojením zariadenia: cez tunel, keď VPN beží; so zapnutým kill switchom a vypnutým tunelom sa stiahnuť nedá."

msgid "Refresh all"
msgstr "Obnoviť všetky"

msgid "No subscriptions yet."
msgstr "Zatiaľ žiadne odbery."

msgid "Host"
msgstr "Hostiteľ"

msgid "Updated"
msgstr "Aktualizované"

msgid "Share links"
msgstr "Zdieľané odkazy"

msgid "A refresh keeps the profiles whose name is unchanged, adds the new ones and removes the ones that are gone (the active one stays while the VPN is on, marked as gone). A refresh of the active profile restarts the running VPN."
msgstr "Obnovenie zachová profily s nezmeneným názvom, pridá nové a odstráni zaniknuté (aktívny zostane, kým VPN beží, označený ako zaniknutý). Obnovenie aktívneho profilu reštartuje bežiacu VPN."

msgid "Dashboard info failed"
msgstr "Informácie prehľadu zlyhali"

# Source-language fallback for untranslated new controls.
msgid "The modem is restarting (network locks or a SIM switch): no live signal right now"
msgstr "The modem is restarting (network locks or a SIM switch): no live signal right now"

msgid "Live signal read failed"
msgstr "Čítanie živého signálu zlyhalo"

msgid "Unknown op"
msgstr "Neznáma operácia"

msgid "Invalid argument for this op"
msgstr "Neplatný argument pre túto operáciu"

msgid "The radio is busy: the dial or the watchdog is switching it, try again shortly"
msgstr "Rádio je zaneprázdnené: prepína ho vytáčanie alebo watchdog, skúste to o chvíľu znova"

msgid "The action gave no valid reply"
msgstr "Akcia nevrátila platnú odpoveď"

msgid "The confirm parameter must be 0 or 1"
msgstr "Parameter confirm musí byť 0 alebo 1"

msgid "An AT command is one line of printable ASCII, at most 512 characters"
msgstr "Príkaz AT je jeden riadok tlačiteľných znakov ASCII, najviac 512 znakov"

msgid "Must be an AT command"
msgstr "Musí ísť o príkaz AT"

msgid "No \";\" command chaining"
msgstr "Žiadne reťazenie príkazov pomocou \";\""

msgid "Denied: this command wedges the AT port until a reboot"
msgstr "Zamietnuté: tento príkaz zablokuje port AT až do reštartu"

msgid "Denied: this command moves the SIM selection or the data route; the SIM settings do that"
msgstr "Denied: this command moves the SIM selection or the data route; the SIM settings do that"

# Source-language fallback for untranslated new controls.
msgid "The modem is restarting (network locks or a SIM switch, about half a minute), try again shortly"
msgstr "The modem is restarting (network locks or a SIM switch, about half a minute), try again shortly"

msgid "A long AT command is still running in the background; try again when it has finished"
msgstr "Na pozadí stále beží dlhý príkaz AT; skúste to znova, keď skončí"

msgid "This command needs confirmation"
msgstr "Tento príkaz vyžaduje potvrdenie"

msgid "The AT channel is busy; the command was not sent, try again"
msgstr "Kanál AT je obsadený; príkaz nebol odoslaný, skúste to znova"

msgid "The modem did not answer in time; the command may still run, check before sending it again"
msgstr "Modem neodpovedal včas; príkaz môže stále bežať, pred opätovným odoslaním to overte"

msgid "The fresh parameter must be 0 or 1"
msgstr "Parameter fresh musí byť 0 alebo 1"

msgid "Reading the locks from the modem; try again in a few seconds"
msgstr "Zámky sa čítajú z modemu; skúste to znova o niekoľko sekúnd"

msgid "Lock read failed"
msgstr "Čítanie zámkov zlyhalo"

msgid "Unknown lock kind"
msgstr "Neznámy druh zámku"

msgid "Invalid value for this lock kind"
msgstr "Neplatná hodnota pre tento druh zámku"

msgid "None of these bands is supported by this modem"
msgstr "Tento modem nepodporuje žiadne z týchto pásiem"

msgid "Band, mode and cell locks are not supported for SIM2 yet"
msgstr "Zámky pásiem, režimu a bunky zatiaľ nie sú pre SIM2 podporované"

